          "title": "CPU utilization (host)",
          "description": "USE: Utilization. Share of CPU time not idle, averaged across cores. Host-wide (the Docker VM), NOT per service, so it does not change with the service dropdown. Sustained > 80% can explain rising latency across many services at once.",
          "links": [],
          "data": {
            "kind": "QueryGroup",
            "spec": {
              "queries": [
